      {name := "play_move never crosses authority or scope", task := "play_move", mode := .never, probability := none, predicate := "a person moves for another seat, for an autopilot seat, or out of turn; a stale move number or replayed request changes the board twice; a move arriving after the seat's clock ran out is accepted instead of the timeout; an occupied or off-board point, a ko-forbidden recapture or a situational-superko repetition is accepted; or a move is accepted after the game finished"},
